    skos:prefLabel "Kate Raworth"@en .

tgs:Persona.NateHagens a thinkr:Persona, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    thinkr:actsThrough tgs:Human.NateHagens ;
    skos:prefLabel "Nate Hagens"@en ;
    foaf:homepage
        <https://www.natehagens.com/>,
        <https://natehagens.substack.com/>,
        <https://www.linkedin.com/in/nate-hagens-004810b/> ;
    thinkr:hasTGSRole
        thinkr:ProfessionalRole.Educator, 
        thinkr:ProfessionalRole.InstituteExecutive, 
        thinkr:ProfessionalRole.Blogger, 
        thinkr:ProfessionalRole.Author ;
    thinkr:hasPersonalRelationship
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_MatthewMonahan,
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_ArtBerman,
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_JoshFarley ;
    thinkr:hasProfessionalRelationship
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_MatthewMonahan,
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_IainMcGilchrist,
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_DanielSchmachtenberger,
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_TheOilDrum,
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_PostCarbonInstitute,
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_UniversityOfMinnesota,
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_ArtBerman,
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_JoshFarley,
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_GayaHerrington ;
    thinkr:hasAcademicRelationship 
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_UniversityOfMinnesota, 
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_JoshFarley ;
    thinkr:hasIntellectualRelationship tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_PeakOilMovement ;
    skos:scopeNote "Rebuilt 2026-07-14, Batch 3 of the Persona-centered refactor: hasTGSRole and hasPersonalRelationship moved here from tgs:Human.NateHagens (both public-facing facts, not biography) — Human.NateHagens no longer asserts either. EXTENDED Batch 4 (same day): hasPersonalRelationship now includes the 3 organization/school Relationship individuals folded in from persona_human_prototype-8.ttl (Oil Drum, Post Carbon Institute, Peak Oil movement), plus Relationship.NateHagens_UniversityOfMinnesota — which already existed in relationships.ttl before this session but was never actually linked back here, a real pre-existing gap closed in passing. foaf:homepage (natehagens.com/Substack/LinkedIn) MOVED here from tgs:Human.NateHagens 2026-07-15, resolving the open question from the 2026-07-12 escalation entry: ALL homepage links belong on Persona, no split — a homepage is a public-facing fact like every other property already migrated under design decision 0f, not biography (see tgs:Human.NateHagens's own updated comment). RETROFITTED 2026-07-15: hasPersonalRelationship had incorrectly held all 7 Relationships regardless of actual thinkr:hasRelationshipType — split across the new hasPersonalRelationship/hasProfessionalRelationship/hasAcademicRelationship family per each Relationship's own asserted type(s) (see tgs-core.ttl's hasPersonalRelationship comment for the full retrofit story). Only Relationship.NateHagens_MatthewMonahan carries RelationshipType.Personal, so it's the only one still under hasPersonalRelationship; UniversityOfMinnesota alone also carries Academic. SECOND CORRECTION same day: Relationship.NateHagens_PeakOilMovement was itself mistagged RelationshipType.Professional (not just filed under the wrong property) — MJSullivan caught that a Persona->SchoolOfThought 'subscribes to this movement's ideas' connection isn't Professional at all, prompting the new RelationshipType.Intellectual/hasIntellectualRelationship pair. Moved here accordingly, no longer under hasProfessionalRelationship. THIRD CORRECTION same day: has*Relationship had only ever been asserted on ONE side of each Relationship (whichever Persona happened to get bootstrapped/enriched), never symmetrically — Nate is thinkr:hasSubject on Relationship.NateHagens_ArtBerman/_JoshFarley/_GayaHerrington but none were listed here despite being listed on the guest's own Persona. MJSullivan confirmed both parties should list a Relationship (when both are Personas) — added here accordingly, matching each Relationship's real hasRelationshipType exactly (Berman: Personal+Professional; Farley: Personal+Professional+Academic; Herrington: Professional only, unchanged from her own original bootstrap)."@en .

tgs:Persona.MatthewMonahan a thinkr:Persona, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    thinkr:actsThrough tgs:Human.MatthewMonahan ;
    thinkr:hasPersonEntityType thinkr:PersonEntityType.Guest ;
    thinkr:hasPersonalRelationship tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_MatthewMonahan ;
    thinkr:hasProfessionalRelationship 
        tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_MatthewMonahan, 
        tgs:Relationship.MatthewMonahan_MangaroaFarms ;
    skos:prefLabel "Matthew Monahan"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "hasPersonEntityType moved here from tgs:Human.MatthewMonahan, 2026-07-14, Batch 3. has*Relationship ADDED 2026-07-15: this Persona previously had none at all despite being thinkr:hasSubject on Relationship.MatthewMonahan_MangaroaFarms and thinkr:hasObject on Relationship.NateHagens_MatthewMonahan — a real completeness gap caught during the symmetric-indexing audit (see Persona.NateHagens's own scopeNote for the fuller story)."@en .

tgs:Persona.IainMcGilchrist a thinkr:Persona, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    thinkr:actsThrough tgs:Human.IainMcGilchrist ;
    thinkr:hasPersonEntityType 
        thinkr:PersonEntityType.Guest, 
        thinkr:PersonEntityType.Contributor ;
    thinkr:hasProfessionalRelationship tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_IainMcGilchrist ;
    skos:prefLabel "Iain McGilchrist"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "hasPersonEntityType moved here from tgs:Human.IainMcGilchrist, 2026-07-14, Batch 3. hasProfessionalRelationship ADDED 2026-07-15: closing a symmetric-indexing gap found during the has*Relationship audit (see Persona.NateHagens's own scopeNote)."@en .

tgs:Persona.DanielSchmachtenberger a thinkr:Persona, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    thinkr:actsThrough tgs:Human.DanielSchmachtenberger ;
    thinkr:hasPersonEntityType thinkr:PersonEntityType.Guest ;
    thinkr:hasProfessionalRelationship tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_DanielSchmachtenberger ;
    skos:prefLabel "Daniel Schmachtenberger"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "hasPersonEntityType moved here from tgs:Human.DanielSchmachtenberger, 2026-07-14, Batch 3. hasProfessionalRelationship ADDED 2026-07-15: closing a symmetric-indexing gap found during the has*Relationship audit (see Persona.NateHagens's own scopeNote)."@en .

